-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ב/4 (10.2.2022), עדכון תוספת שקלית 2016 לעובדי הוראה
-- בחטיבה העליונה ובכיתות יג'-יד' ועדכון תוספת 87 מעבר לרפורמה למנהלים בחטיבה
-- העליונה בעוז לתמורה.
-- The CPI update, from 1.1.2022, of the 2016 shekel supplement in the upper
-- division and grades 13-14, and of the '87 reform-transition supplement of
-- principals under Oz LaTmura: who it applies to, the amounts, and when.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תשפ"ב/4 עדכון תוספת שקלית 2016 בחטיבה העליונה ותוספת 87 מעבר לרפורמה למנהלים`

-- akn:preamble/p1 akn:preamble/p2 akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 The letterhead, the date and the reference number; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 akn:preamble/p12 The circular's number, the addressees, the greeting and the subject line; no rule.

§§ `Front matter: the indexation and the scope`

-- ¶13 names the sources: the wage agreements of 14.3.2018 (§§5א(ב), 5ב(ב))
-- and 23.3.2017 (§4ד), and the earlier circulars תשע"ז/4, תשע"ח/5, תשע"ט/3,
-- תש"פ/3, תשפ"א/5. Its rule is that the supplement is linked to the CPI.
-- The index values are not printed; they are inputs.
@ref akn:preamble/p13
GIVEN `amount set by the agreements` IS A NUMBER @desc the supplement as the collective agreements set it, before indexation
      `index of the update`          IS A NUMBER @desc the consumer price index the update is made to
      `index of the base`            IS A NUMBER @desc the consumer price index the agreements' amount stands at
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the supplement linked to the CPI` `amount set by the agreements` `index of the update` `index of the base` IS
    `to the agora` (`amount set by the agreements` TIMES (`index of the update` DIVIDED BY `index of the base`))

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `to the agora` x IS
    ROUND (x TIMES 100) DIVIDED BY 100

-- ¶14: the circular governs the period from 1 January 2022 onward. ¶15: the
-- update is to the December 2021 index (published January 2022) against the
-- December 2019 index (published January 2020).
@ref akn:preamble/p14 akn:preamble/p15
`the index the update is made to` MEANS `the index of December 2021`
`the index the update is measured against` MEANS `the index of December 2019`

@desc A consumer price index by the month it measures (the index is published the month after).
DECLARE `consumer price index` IS ONE OF
    `the index of December 2019`
    `the index of December 2021`

-- ¶16: who the circular applies to; ¶17: whether or not under Oz LaTmura.
@ref akn:preamble/p16 akn:preamble/p17
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the circular applies to` e IF
        e's `rated on the teaching-employee scale`
    AND e's `employed by an owner of a supervised institution`
    AND e's `employed in the upper division or grades 13-14`

@desc A teaching employee as far as this circular asks about it.
DECLARE `upper-division employee` HAS
    `rated on the teaching-employee scale`                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed by an owner of a supervised institution`     IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed by an owner of educational institutions the Ministry of Education supervises
    `employed in the upper division or grades 13-14`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `a principal`                                          IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed as a school principal (otherwise a teacher)
    `employed under Oz LaTmura`                            IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed under the terms of the Oz LaTmura reform

§§ `א. עדכון תוספת שקלית 2016`

@desc Who a printed row of section א names: the two rows as printed, and the second row read narrowly (F-2021-22_tashpab_04-a).
DECLARE `row category` IS ONE OF
    `teachers under Oz LaTmura`
    `teachers not under Oz LaTmura, and principals`
    `teachers and principals not under Oz LaTmura`

@desc One printed row of §א's amounts: from 1.1.2022, the monthly amount and the amount it replaces.
DECLARE `shekel supplement row` HAS
    `row category`           IS A `row category`
    `amount from 1.1.2022`   IS A NUMBER
    `amount it replaces`     IS A NUMBER

-- ¶2: "מורים ברפורמת עוז לתמורה". A principal is not a "מורה" in the
-- agreements' vocabulary, which names teachers and principals apart (¶3).
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teacher under Oz LaTmura` e IF
        e's `employed under Oz LaTmura`
    AND (NOT e's `a principal`)

-- ¶3: "מורים שאינם ברפורמת עוז לתמורה ומנהלים". F-2021-22_tashpab_04-a: the words
-- read two ways. The reading adopted: "and principals" is every principal.
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teacher not under Oz LaTmura, or a principal` e IF
        e's `a principal`
    OR  (NOT e's `employed under Oz LaTmura`)

-- The other reading: "שאינם ברפורמת עוז לתמורה" qualifies the principals too.
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teacher or principal not under Oz LaTmura` e IF
        NOT e's `employed under Oz LaTmura`

GIVEN c IS A `row category`, e IS AN `upper-division employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the row names` c e IF
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `teachers under Oz LaTmura` THEN `a teacher under Oz LaTmura` e
    WHEN `teachers not under Oz LaTmura, and principals` THEN `a teacher not under Oz LaTmura, or a principal` e
    WHEN `teachers and principals not under Oz LaTmura` THEN `a teacher or principal not under Oz LaTmura` e

@ref akn:art_a/p1 akn:art_a/p2 akn:art_a/p3
`the shekel supplement 2016 from 1.1.2022` MEANS
    LIST `shekel supplement row` `teachers under Oz LaTmura`                      1433.98 1404.62,
         `shekel supplement row` `teachers not under Oz LaTmura, and principals` 1212.59 1187.76

GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the amounts the rows give` e IS
    map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `amount from 1.1.2022`)
        (filter (GIVEN r YIELD `the row names` (r's `row category`) e) `the shekel supplement 2016 from 1.1.2022`)

@export The monthly 2016 shekel supplement from 1 January 2022 for a full-position teaching employee in the upper division or grades 13-14, under circular תשפ"ב/4
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee` @desc the employee
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the shekel supplement 2016 in the upper division` e IS
    IF `the circular applies to` e
    THEN sum (`the amounts the rows give` e)
    ELSE 0

@ref akn:art_a/p4
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `update action`
DECIDE `reimbursement for the shekel supplement` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `reimburse the owner at the hour cost in the payment system`

DECLARE `update action` IS ONE OF
    `reimburse the owner at the hour cost in the payment system`
    `reimburse the owner in payment-system topic 558`
    `pay the '87 transition supplement` HAS `monthly amount paid` IS A NUMBER, `retroactive to January 2022` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `ב. עדכון סכום תוספת 87' מעבר רפורמה למנהלים`

-- ¶1: under the agreement and §18 of circular תשע"ח/9, the '87
-- reform-transition supplement of principals employed under Oz LaTmura is
-- updated by the same index change as the 2016 shekel supplement above.
@ref akn:art_b/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`
      `amount before the update` IS A NUMBER @desc the principal's '87 transition supplement before this update
      `index of the update`      IS A NUMBER @desc the December 2021 index
      `index of the base`        IS A NUMBER @desc the December 2019 index
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the '87 transition supplement for principals, updated by the index` e `amount before the update` `index of the update` `index of the base` IS
    IF `entitled to the '87 transition supplement for principals` e
    THEN `the supplement linked to the CPI` `amount before the update` `index of the update` `index of the base`
    ELSE 0

GIVEN e IS AN `upper-division employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the '87 transition supplement for principals` e IF
        `the circular applies to` e
    AND e's `a principal`
    AND e's `employed under Oz LaTmura`

@ref akn:art_b/p2
`the '87 transition supplement from 1.1.2022` MEANS 1046.15
`the '87 transition supplement it replaces`   MEANS 1024.73

-- ¶3: pay from January 2022's salary and no later than February 2022's,
-- with arrears for January. Time is in school months (common.l4: September
-- is 1, so January is 5 and February 6).
@ref akn:art_b/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `update action`
DECIDE `paying the updated '87 transition supplement` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the '87 transition supplement` amount retro
          PROVIDED amount AT LEAST `the '87 transition supplement from 1.1.2022` AND retro
    WITHIN `month number` February
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ב/4 §ב: the updated supplement is paid no later than February 2022's salary, with arrears for January"

@ref akn:art_b/p4
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `update action`
DECIDE `reimbursement for the '87 transition supplement` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `reimburse the owner in payment-system topic 558`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: the signatures of the two officials and the list of copies; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- The rows read narrowly, for F-2021-22_tashpab_04-a.
`the rows read narrowly` MEANS
    LIST `shekel supplement row` `teachers under Oz LaTmura`                     1433.98 1404.62,
         `shekel supplement row` `teachers and principals not under Oz LaTmura` 1212.59 1187.76

`a principal under Oz LaTmura` MEANS
    `upper-division employee` WITH
        `rated on the teaching-employee scale`             IS TRUE
        `employed by an owner of a supervised institution` IS TRUE
        `employed in the upper division or grades 13-14`   IS TRUE
        `a principal`                                      IS TRUE
        `employed under Oz LaTmura`                        IS TRUE

-- F-2021-22_tashpab_04-a: read as printed with "and principals" meaning all
-- principals, a principal under Oz LaTmura has an amount; read with the
-- qualifier reaching the principals, no row gives one.
`a principal under Oz LaTmura has a row only if the principals are not qualified by the reform` MEANS
        count (filter (GIVEN r YIELD `the row names` (r's `row category`) `a principal under Oz LaTmura`) `the shekel supplement 2016 from 1.1.2022`) EQUALS 1
    AND count (filter (GIVEN r YIELD `the row names` (r's `row category`) `a principal under Oz LaTmura`) `the rows read narrowly`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `a principal under Oz LaTmura has a row only if the principals are not qualified by the reform`

-- Every employee gets exactly one row under the reading adopted.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN e YIELD count (`the amounts the rows give` e) EQUALS 1)
            (LIST `a principal under Oz LaTmura`,
                  `upper-division employee` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE,
                  `upper-division employee` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE,
                  `upper-division employee` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE)


-- The three printed updates are one index change: the factor the '87 row
-- implies (1,046.15 / 1,024.73) reproduces the other two rows to the agora.
`the index change the '87 row implies` MEANS
    `the '87 transition supplement from 1.1.2022` DIVIDED BY `the '87 transition supplement it replaces`

#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD `to the agora` (r's `amount it replaces` TIMES `the index change the '87 row implies`) EQUALS r's `amount from 1.1.2022`)
            `the shekel supplement 2016 from 1.1.2022`

#ASSERT `the shekel supplement 2016 in the upper division` (`upper-division employee` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS 1433.98
#ASSERT `the shekel supplement 2016 in the upper division` (`upper-division employee` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `entitled to the '87 transition supplement for principals` `a principal under Oz LaTmura`

#TRACE `paying the updated '87 transition supplement` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the '87 transition supplement` 1046.15 TRUE AT 6
#TRACE `paying the updated '87 transition supplement` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the '87 transition supplement` 1024.73 FALSE AT 6
